{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Bound cleanup after suspension or retry.** Even after the manager selects `PENDING` or `RETRYING`, this blocks until the handler and its `finally` blocks return. A blocked cleanup can consume the Lambda deadline and prevent the durable response from reaching the service. Race cleanup against the remaining invocation time, reserving finalization/transport budget, and propagate a retryable invocation failure when it expires.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77qp5m","finding_digest":"d34970da8c622b783e59c3d63971052058c1ab1e1e5ea29410929a444e633510","finding_id":"arf_v1_2nexbwummivxqpszyplds4ifeb","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::suspension-liveness","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::suspension-liveness","line":126,"observation_digest":"81e8f19841aa6e8c60c59e7524001ed8b9e6bfcc351604aecbfba9ba99baa9ce","observation_id":"aro_v1_qhupdgcbvjxiyygftz2siaa63c","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_2nexbwummivxqpszyplds4ifeb","published_at":"2026-10-08T17:41:34Z","review_id":"arr_v1_w4f4vfmlkvk6yuwzqbo6rmxwrf","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"6c590162ee0e40cbba600285b7fafbadc0457c8e","reviewer":"codex","start_line":126,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_idnf5fqx63dfm2h7i6gctcfxrg","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T17:41:34Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
